  "details": "There are many worlds whose avatars are too bright or too dark,\nmaybe due to just mistake by world creator.\ntherefore avatar creators often bothering shader settings.\nIf avatars are less affected by lighting, then less the world creator can express with lighting.\ntherefore I want to add wanings to world SDK to guide world creators like below.\n* No both realtime light and light probes.\n* There is realtime directional light that intensity over 1.0\n* not existing light that intensity over 0.5\n* light intensity beyond the standard brightness range 0.7 - 1.0\nnote: number of range is need more consideration",
